From: "leng.fang" <leng.fang@amlogic.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Mar 2025 09:16:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] weston: support the function of displaying the same content
 on dual screens [1/1]

PD#SH-23882

Problem:
support the function of displaying the same content on dual screens,
and secondary screen maintains aspect ratio.

Solution:
use the same fb when displaying on different screens

Verify:
A311D2

Signed-off-by: leng.fang <leng.fang@amlogic.com>
